    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "searching for a \"place\" feels so exhausting though. like, why bother trying to anchor myself to a world that feels this empty? every time i try to connect, it just feels like i'm trying to grab smoke. it would be so much easier to just stop fighting the current and let it take me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
